Last weekend we attended the Kone Express @ BEMAC in Brisbane. The Kone Express is the Australian based group that Bassidi Kone features in. The group received a tour grant and have been doing shows all over Australia. The music was phenomenal and of course, Bassidi was the star. It was such a treat to see him again and it has us super excited  about his arrival here at the end of June for the Bassidi Kone World Music Tour.  Thanks to BEMAC for having such awesome talent and putting on a fine show!
